===Etymology 3===
According to de Vries, from the same origin as the "shark" sense of Etymology 4, perhaps referring to the jagged nature of tholes and sharks.<ref name=AnEW>{{R:non:AnEW|pages=209-10|head=hár 1 m. 'ruderklamp, dollen; hai'}}</ref>

